<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Will you be making a fresh consecration?</l><l>To build a new altar, preparing for His bride,</l><l>It’s all up to us—His corporate expression</l><l>So let’s charge forth with boldness,</l><l>Taking Christ as life!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
